The '''Serenno Camp'''<ref name="Dooku: Jedi Lost script">[[Dooku: Jedi Lost (script)|''Dooku: Jedi Lost'' script]]</ref> was a camp set up in [[42 BBY]]<ref name="Date" /> during the [[Incident on Serenno|Invasion of Serenno]] on a [[mountain]]. The camp housed many veterans that were wounded. After [[Jenza]], [[Dooku]]'s sister, met up with [[Jedi Master]]s Dooku, [[Lene Kostana]] and [[Sifo-Dyas]], a [[groundquake]] caused by the [[Tirra'Taka]], an ancient species of [[Reptile|reptilian]] [[dragon]]s, led to a rockslide on the mountain the camp was situated in. This caused half the [[tent]]s there to be demolished, scattering supplies across the mountain side. When the Jedi Masters, Jenza and [[Sergeant]] [[Eson]] of [[House Borgin]] arrived at the scene, they immediately took care of the wounded. While taking care of the wounded, Dooku met [[Hagi]], the [[Countess]] of [[House Malvern]] where she stated that she saw his [[Gora|father]] in him.<ref name="Dooku: Jedi Lost">''[[Dooku: Jedi Lost]]''</ref>

